OL,3,GNEWSAAirport air traffic control strike
OL,4,Aaction halted
OL,5,
OL,6,FImminent strikes by air traffic
OL,7,Fcontrollers at Leeds Bradford Airport
OL,8,Fhave been suspended following a "late
OL,9,Foffer" from the airport, a union said.
OL,11,FWorkers were due to walk out in a pay
OL,12,Fdispute between Friday and Sunday,
OL,13,FUnite said, but this was suspended to
OL,14,Fallow air traffic controllers to be
OL,15,Fballoted on the new offer.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
