OL,3,GNEWSAAirport air traffic control strike
OL,4,Aaction halted
OL,5,
OL,6,FHourly paid staff, including security,
OL,7,Fcheck-in staff, passport control
OL,8,Fworkers and passenger assistants could
OL,9,Fstill walk out from Friday if a
OL,10,Fseparate pay offer is rejected on
OL,11,FWednesday. Strikes between 23 October
OL,12,Fand 2 November may also still go ahead.
OL,14,FThe airport welcomed the "positive"
OL,15,Fdecision to suspend the strike, adding
OL,16,Fit would be "operating as normal this
OL,17,Fweekend".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
